      "content": "what do you mean \"not having to face the world\"? i have to face it eventually. i have to explain this to my family, my neighbors, my employees... i'll be the guy who lost everything. it feels like every direction i turn, i'm just going to hit more embarrassment. it's just so exhausting to even think about the humiliation of the aftermath.",
